t1bridge-ubuntu (@VERSION@) @SERIES@; urgency=medium

  * Ubuntu packaging of T1Bridge v0.1.12 (upstream commit 81cbdf8).
  * apple_t1_socw module for the T1 sleep/wake call (ASOC.SOCW).
  * ufw rule for the xART port on the T1 link only; initrd rebuild on
    install and removal (dracut copies the DKMS modules).
  * Link order fix for --as-needed toolchains (debian/patches).

